istributive property as previously mentioned, but the direct multiplication method is often quicker and more straightforward.\n\nUsing known facts, we can also simplify the calculation:\n- \\(15 \\times 7 = 105\\)\n- \\(15 \\times 70 = 1050\\)\n- \\(1050 + 105 = 1155\\)\n\nTherefore, the product of 15 and 77 is 1155.\n</answer>",
